3961	3504	That depends on the definition and reason (purpose) for growth. How is it harnessed and to what end? Perhaps it is my maleness that puts purpose before meaning, purpose and meaning are husband and wife, a healthy happy marriage respects the nature of both in intelligent cooperation. Engagement for the sake of engagement seems purposeless to me. Doing so just because it feels good seems a bit self-indulgent - meaning without purpose. The potential of the commons in my view is not only making sense together, but also in acting coherently on the sense made. What is the point of sensemaking otherwise? My reason for being at Rebel Wisdom was a desire to make a difference, that is my reason for being in the commons also. Creating collective intelligence to bring to bare on the metacrisis.	\N	2023-11-07 23:15:48.740117	2023-11-15 10:18:45.054289	177	iED78yan1RM2uendCS7Fg9hC	0
