601	Olof Wood	olofwood@gmail.com	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/members/10731098	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/chats/new?user_id=10731098	\N	2022-03-29 00:00:00	existing	Fort Collins, CO	Do you know someone in this community?  If so, please share their name!\n\\I participated in Rebel Wisdom's sensmaking 101 course and met many people I hope to connect with more here including Burton Anderson and Andy Hansen.  -:- What drew you to this community?  What do you hope to experience here?\n\\I was drawn by knowing I need to practice my relating and sensemaking skills more and while my personal relationships are their final testing ground I hope to find a unique space to practice openly with others who are familar with the challenges. -:- We do not have an individual or a team creating, curating or broadcasting content.  It's our members that bring the content, create events, start groups and spark discussion.  What lights you up and how do you think you might share that here?\\I am excited by exploring. I practice parkour, climbing, and swimming to explore the physical world and often those skills overlap with mental explorations of questions and ideas. I'm here to see some of these questions explored by others and I like Jamie Wheel's rule of "always find your way back to the one." I hope being engauged with others will help me develop a sense of common reality.  -:- The following list shows some of the interests of some members in this community.  To help us understand where our new members are starting out (this is not a test), please let us know which of the following topics you are familiar with by typing a number after each from 1 to 5, with 1= not familiar and 5= very familiar.  \nA) Integral Theory    B) Game B    C) Sensemaking    D) Complex Theory   E) Meditation     F) We-Space practices like Circling, Authentic Relating and/or Collective Presencing\\A) 3 have a basic overview and am familiar with its practices but am not personally involved in the source material \nB) 3 C) 4 D) 3 E) 4 F) 3 -:- We are dedicated to consciously communicating with care and honesty. We question our own beliefs, explore comfort in not knowing, and welcome shared inquiry. We are willing to have difficult conversations and make space to hear another. We check in with ourselves about our reactions and needs in conversation.  When we don't meet our standards we are committed to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\Yes please	\N	\N	2022-12-11 08:05:12.258421	2023-10-19 03:47:50.656572	\N	Olof	Wood	10731098	America/Denver	USA	1bLyz6C8B3pdbSNPWiRcBDBi	Yr91S--bEt5xAZ-JafCFVQ	\N	\N	\N	t	\N	\N	f
