o joining our community and relating in this way?\\yes	\N	\N	2023-02-22 22:03:06.201869	2023-10-19 03:47:52.981302	\N	Simon	Carter	14606437	\N	\N	VRcpqRwkFG4DQr6hqNZFUTyd	\N	\N	\N	\N	t	\N	\N	t
