ion our own beliefs, explore comfort in not knowing, and welcome shared inquiry. We are willing to have difficult conversations and make space to hear another. We check in with ourselves about our reactions and needs in conversation.  When we don't meet our standards we are committed to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\Yes. Very much so.	\N	\N	2022-11-25 06:57:19.621053	2023-10-19 03:47:51.261063	\N	Teresa	Zimmermann	12411804	Europe/Vienna	AUT	1bDpQePq5m8FDZzN8Xgt9YxK	iqpO66cTI7lqpPI_U8zQ5w	\N	\N	\N	t	\N	\N	f
