683	Kris Langbridge	kris.langbridge@gmail.com	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/members/14405810	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/chats/new?user_id=14405810	2023-01-04 08:54:00	\N	Zoom Done (completed)	\N	Do you know someone in this community?  If so, please share their full name.\n\\Not directly. Recommended by Alex B from Rebel Wisdom -:- Because a main focus in this community is relational in nature, we strongly using real names-- at the very least a first name and last initial.  We also strongly encourage the use of real photos. What drew you to this community?  What do you hope to experience here?\n\\to meet other people interested in the same questions, and learn new practices\n -:- We do not have an individual or a team creating, curating or broadcasting content.  It's our members that bring the content, create events, start groups and spark discussion.  What lights you up and how do you think you might share that here?\\I am curious to explore new ways to look at old problems and to find ways to understand / provide context to this experience. I have a background in psychology, technology and interests span from philosophy, altered states of consciousness, lucid dreaming, ancient civilizations and the environment. -:- The following list shows some interests of some members in this community.  To help us understand where our new members are starting out (this is not a test), please let us know which of the following topics you are familiar with by typing a number after each from 1 to 5, with 1= not familiar and 5= very familiar.  \nA) Integral Theory    B) Game B    C) Sensemaking    D) Complexity Theory   E) Meditation     F) We-Space practices like Circling, Authentic Relating and/or Collective Presencing\\A=2, B=2, C=4, D=3, E=3, F=1  -:- We are dedicated to consciously communicating with care and honesty. We question our own beliefs, explore comfort in not knowing, and welcome shared inquiry. We are willing to have difficult conversations and make space to hear another. We check in with ourselves about our reactions and needs in conversation.  When we don't meet our standards we are committed to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\yes ! 	interview request emailed 1/25/2025 - Approved by Kevin Triplett	\N	2023-01-04 09:00:43.447723	2024-01-25 21:44:57.249643	2023-01-19 17:30:00	Kris	Langbridge	\N	\N	\N	UTzK3qPddyBfyryXwdUUj4TG	5gIu3AeWOxmfBJ8DKWPfyA	2023-01-04T14:59:53Z by Kevin Triplett:\n- notes changed: (blank) -> Approved by Kevin Triplett\n- status changed: Pending -> Joined!\n2023-01-05 15:10:00 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- status changed: Joined! -> 1st Email Sent\n2023-01-05 15:10:05 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- status changed: 1st Email Sent -> Joined!\n2023-01-05 15:10:06 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- status changed: Joined! -> 1st Email Sent\n2023-01-05 20:38:13 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- greeter_id changed: 329 -> Kevin Triplett\n2023-01-08 01:17:44 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- status changed: 1st Email Sent -> Greet Scheduled\n2023-01-08 01:17:47 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- when_timestamp changed: (blank) -> 2023-01-12T06:00:00.000Z\n2023-01-08 01:18:03 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- when_timestamp changed: 2023-01-12 06:00:00 UTC -> 2023-01-12T17:30:00.000Z\n2023-01-12 05:10:19 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- when_timestamp changed: 2023-01-12 17:30:00 UTC -> 2023-01-19T17:30:00.000Z\n2024-01-25 21:44:57 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- notes changed: Approved by Kevin Triplett -> interview request emailed 1/25/2025 - Approved by Kevin Triplett\n	329	\N	t	\N	\N	\N
