446	Derick Galea	derick.galea@hotmail.com	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/members/8377816	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/chats/new?user_id=8377816	\N	2021-08-24 00:00:00	existing	Waipa District, New Zealand	What drew you to this community and what are you hoping to experience here?\n\\A current member recommended I join up, though I have been following Rebel Wisdom and The Stoa since they started. I am interested in sharing some artistic productions (literary and visual) and seeing what creativity other members share. I have started some authentic relating practices with another group and would be keen to join in any such thing going on there. I'm also keen to join discussions about philosphy/spirituality/culture and to learn about as many other perspectives as possible :)  -:- How did you hear about us?\n\\A current member recommended the group to me, though I did hear David Fuller talk about it on a podcast also.  -:- What lights you up and how do you think you might share that here?\\Imaginitve exploration of the possible, and the attempt to bring the best of that into reality. I love sharing ideas, but I also want to put them into practice, and having other people to do that with and learn from increases my motivation and ability to do so.  -:- To help us understand where our new members are starting out, please let us know which of the following topics you are familiar with, and type a number from 1-5 after the name where 1 = not very familiar and 5 = very familiar.\n\n* Integral Theory\n* Game B\n* Sensemaking\n* Complexity Theory\n* Circling\n* Authentic Relating\n* Meditation\n* Collective Presencing\n\\3\n4\n5\n5\n2\n3\n4\n2 -:- Do you already know a member of this community that would help guide you and speak well of your joining? Please enter their name below:\\Adriana Forte Naili	\N	\N	2022-12-11 08:05:07.386299	2023-10-19 03:47:49.386602	\N	Derick	Galea	8377816	Pacific/Auckland	NZL	16VQ8fMGJFvkVfqbuA7pdKGx	pqf-DTSZyWmaeFqlM9e70g	\N	\N	\N	t	\N	\N	f
