d to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\Yes, absolutely. 		\N	2022-11-25 20:00:51.713727	2023-10-19 03:47:52.595105	2022-11-30 17:00:00	Matt	Scaysbrook	13810155	\N	\N	nFqsa4CyADoauBZn1u9grCtb	bEY4vVa8rUVoljyQghFGSA	2023-01-06 23:14:41 UTC by Kimberly Lathrop:\n- greeter_id changed: (blank) -> Kimberly Lathrop\n	215	\N	t	\N	\N	f
