d inquiry. We are willing to have difficult conversations and make space to hear another. We check in with ourselves about our reactions and needs in conversation.  When we don't meet our standards we are committed to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\Absolutely! Couldn’t be more aligned with those values. 	sent engage interview request 1/25 - Had a great zoom meeting, Dan is interested in connection, dialogos and the things that can happen with positive collective intention, particularly group phenomena such as transcendance. He has experience with bridging divides during the Covid lockdown. He seems to have that healthy balance between chaos (divergence and emergence) and structure (convergence). He has prior experience with volunteerism at Andrew Cohen's ashram as a member of the magazine staff. So expect Dan to volunteer at some point :)	\N	2022-11-25 06:57:18.633122	2024-01-25 21:32:14.025627	\N	Dan	Capone	13718638	\N	\N	fwuaTsxkWqafW87jmH9BSXoX	uEzRkY9M8oRsr2AvDd-k7Q	2023-01-09 03:45:46 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- greeter changed: (blank) -> Kevin Triplett\n2023-02-09 23:10:58 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- status changed: Zoom done (completed) -> Zoom Done (completed)\n- when_timestamp changed: 2023-02-09 17:30:00 UTC -> (blank)\n2023-02-09 23:11:30 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- notes changed: Had a great zoom meeting, Dan is interested in connection, dialogos and the things that can happen with positive collective intention, particularly group phenomena such as transcendance. He has experience with bridging divides during the Covid lockdown. He seems to have that healthy balance between chaos (divergence and emergence) and structure (convergence). He has prior experience with volutneerism at Andrew Cohen's ashram as a member of the newsletter staff. So expect Dan to volunteer at some point :) -> Had a great zoom meeting, Dan is interested in connection, dialogos and the things that can happen with