885	Rhiya Pau	rhiyapau93@gmail.com	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/members/18249088	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/chats/new?user_id=18249088	2023-08-16 12:32:00	2023-08-16 00:00:00	Zoom Done (completed)	\N	Do you know someone in this community?  If so, please share their full name.\n\\My friend James Kite suggested this group to me, although I'm not certain he is a member -:- Because a main focus in this community is relational in nature, we strongly encourage using real names-- at the very least a first name and last initial.  We also strongly encourage the use of real photos. What drew you to this community?  What do you hope to experience here?\n\\I have a background in physics and philosophy and am also a poet and community builder. I am interested in systems thinking, emergence and the application of evolutionary principles to societal development - I have done a lot of reading on these areas and am looking for a place for communal learning -:- We do not have an individual or a team creating, curating or broadcasting content.  It's our members that bring the content, create events, start groups and spark discussion.  What lights you up and how do you think you might share that here?\\I am really interested in studies of consciousness, evolution and emergence- the work of thinkers like David Deutsch and Daniel Dennett. I want to find spaces to explore how these intellectual ideas can be developed to move society forward alongside psychedelic and spiritual practices -:- The following list shows some interests of some members in this community.  To help us understand where our new members are starting out (this is not a test), please let us know which of the following topics you are familiar with by typing a number after each from 1 to 5, with 1= not familiar and 5= very familiar.  \nA) Integral Theory    B) Game B    C) Sensemaking    D) Complexity Theory   E) Meditation     F) We-Space practices like Circling, Authentic Relating and/or Collective Presencing\\A)1\nB) 3\nC) 1\nD)1\nE) 4\nF) 4 -:- We are dedicated to consciously communicating with care and honesty. We question our own beliefs, explore comfort in not knowing, and welcome shared inquiry. We are willing to have difficult conversations and make space to hear another. We check in with ourselves about our reactions and needs in conversation.  When we don't meet our standards we are committed to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\Yes	email sent to arrange zoom\nzoom call arranged for 21st aug @ noon CET\nI was late for the call, she had left (or possibly didn't show  up - unclear). Have reached out with apology and offer to reschedule. \nMarking done for now.	\N	2023-08-16 13:00:56.944232	2023-10-19 03:47:53.931441	2023-08-21 10:00:00	Rhiya	Pau	18249088	\N	\N	MscsqRDSJXW2sKZ1n87nuqfU	\N	2023-08-16 13:23:08 UTC\n- Join approval requested by Erik H\n2023-08-16 13:23:26 UTC by Erik H:\n- notes changed: (blank) -> email sent to arrange zoom\n2023-08-16 17:01:04 UTC by Erik H:\n- when_timestamp changed: (blank) -> 2023-08-21 10:00:00 UTC\n2023-08-16 17:01:10 UTC by Erik H:\n- notes changed: email sent to arrange zoom -> email sent to arrange zoom\nz\n2023-08-16 17:01:15 UTC by Erik H:\n- notes changed: email sent to arrange zoom\nz -> email sent to arrange zoom\nzoom call arranged for \n2023-08-16 17:01:20 UTC by Erik H:\n- notes changed: email sent to arrange zoom\nzoom call arranged for  -> email sent to arrange zoom\nzoom call arranged for 21st aug @ \n2023-08-16 17:01:25 UTC by Erik H:\n- notes changed: email sent to arrange zoom\nzoom call arranged for 21st aug @  -> email sent to arrange zoom\nzoom call arranged for 21st aug @ noon CET\n2023-08-22 14:58:35 UTC by Erik H:\n- notes changed: email sent to arrange zoom\nzoom call arranged for 21st aug @ noon CET -> email sent to arrange zoom\nzoom call arranged for 21st aug @ noon CET\n\n2023-08-22 14:58:37 UTC by Erik H:\n- notes changed: email se