643	Akemi Schubart	akemi.schubart@gmail.com	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/members/11901053	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/chats/new?user_id=11901053	\N	2022-07-07 00:00:00	existing	London, United Kingdom	Do you know someone in this community?  If so, please share their name!\n\\Alex Goodall -:- What drew you to this community?  What do you hope to experience here?\n\\Stay informed and engaged in the topics covered by Rebel Wisdom (I took the Sensemaking 101 Course in fall 2021 and enjoyed it very much)  -:- We do not have an individual or a team creating, curating or broadcasting content.  It's our members that bring the content, create events, start groups and spark discussion.  What lights you up and how do you think you might share that here?\\I am very interested in Iain McGlchrist's divided brain theory and its implication for the modern world, especially in connection to the rise of autism, ADHD, and many other brain symptoms among children. I also hope to master the sense of embodiment and re-establish the connection with the wider living beings (especially with plants & trees that I love) through various practices touched by Rebel Wisdom courses/videos.  -:- The following list shows some interests of some members in this community.  To help us understand where our new members are starting out (this is not a test), please let us know which of the following topics you are familiar with by typing a number after each from 1 to 5, with 1= not familiar and 5= very familiar.  \nA) Integral Theory    B) Game B    C) Sensemaking    D) Complexity Theory   E) Meditation     F) We-Space practices like Circling, Authentic Relating and/or Collective Presencing\\A) 2\nB) 3\nC) 4\nD) 3\nE) 4\nF) 4 -:- We are dedicated to consciously communicating with care and honesty. We question our own beliefs, explore comfort in not knowing, and welcome shared inquiry. We are willing to have difficult conversations and make space to hear another. We check in with ourselves about our reactions and needs in conversation.  When we don't meet our standards we are committed to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\Yes	\N	\N	2022-12-11 08:05:12.845802	2023-10-19 03:47:50.986607	\N	Akemi	Schubart	11901053	Europe/London	GBR	YzUAURrS3jzeCLbtLPubuKtg	WlLSL9rj3m3Ss8xRRiJeQw	\N	\N	\N	t	\N	\N	f
