22	Tim Streltschenko	candylemming@outlook.com	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/members/13729914	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/chats/new?user_id=13729914	2022-11-20 07:01:00	2022-11-20 00:00:00	Scheduling Zoom	\N	Do you know someone in this community?  If so, please share their full name.\n\\No -:- What drew you to this community?  What do you hope to experience here?\n\\I'm interested in philosophy & cognitive science, I've watched some stoa & rebel wisdom. I want to learn, I'm not much of a speaker, I prefer to listen.\n -:- We do not have an individual or a team creating, curating or broadcasting content.  It's our members that bring the content, create events, start groups and spark discussion.  What lights you up and how do you think you might share that here?\\I'm interested in communication, how it works & doesn't. I'm also a carer both in profession & life. I work in aged care & have ideas about how people should be communicated with. I'm also concerned with the state of the world, the environment, the media, governments etc.\nMy grandfather was Ukranian & current events in this world have caused me to seek answers, I wish peace, love & respect between all peoples,as we are all one, much love.\n -:- The following list shows some interests of some members in this community.  To help us understand where our new members are starting out (this is not a test), please let us know which of the following topics you are familiar with by typing a number after each from 1 to 5, with 1= not familiar and 5= very familiar.  \nA) Integral Theory    B) Game B    C) Sensemaking    D) Complexity Theory   E) Meditation     F) We-Space practices like Circling, Authentic Relating and/or Collective Presencing\\23221 -:- We are dedicated to consciously communicating with care and honesty. We question our own beliefs, explore comfort in not knowing, and welcome shared inquiry. We are willing to have difficult conversations and make space to hear another. We check in with ourselves about our reactions and needs in conversation.  When we don't meet our standards we are committed to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\Yes I do, I think questioning beliefs is about the most important thing one can do.		\N	2022-11-25 06:57:18.473544	2023-10-19 03:47:52.414355	\N	Tim	Streltschenko	13729914	\N	\N	rE1dtyPDLT5Uec6pwAhqsvqa	TPsQyN61dNuucZvHY1QEuA	\N	\N	\N	t	\N	\N	t
