k in with ourselves about our reactions and needs in conversation.  When we don't meet our standards we are committed to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\Leibniz's "Dic cur hic" commands my life\n---> agree		\N	2022-11-25 06:57:18.462507	2023-10-19 03:47:52.429836	2022-11-23 06:00:00	Charles	van der Haegen	13733550	\N	\N	JxWSgVQUx3VvaCDyfmMvwTex	xSkfg6oQOjVZ43S7Slg2Cw	2023-01-09 03:48:25 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- greeter changed: (blank) -> Kevin Triplett\n	329	\N	t	\N	\N	t
