entic Relating and/or Collective Presencing\\A) 4\nB) 3\nC) 3\nD) 1\nE) 5\nF) 1 -:- We are dedicated to consciously communicating with care and honesty. We question our own beliefs, explore comfort in not knowing, and welcome shared inquiry. We are willing to have difficult conversations and make space to hear another. We check in with ourselves about our reactions and needs in conversation.  When we don't meet our standards we are committed to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\Yes! Sounds like a much better internet to me.	email sent to arrange zoom\nzoom arranged for monday 21st aug @ 6PM CET.\nTurned up for zoom while out walking dog, no camera and poor sound, so couldn't really continue. Left it up to him to reschedule if he wants to	\N	2023-08-16 20:30:47.511609	2023-10-19 03:47:53.947772	2023-08-21 16:00:00	Geoff	Gallinger	18256892	\N	\N	RADZsMpFK2N7Apt8NP8Wemts	\N	2023-08-17 08:30:28 UTC\n- Join approval requested by Erik H\n2023-08-17 08:30:51 UTC by Erik H:\n- notes changed: (blank) -> email sent to arrange zoom\n2023-08-17 15:32:52 UTC by Erik H:\n- when_timestamp changed: (blank) -> 2023-08-21 16:00:00 UTC\n2023-08-17 15:33:04 UTC by Erik H:\n- notes changed: email sent to arrange zoom -> email sent to arrange zoom\nzoom arranged for mon\n2023-08-17 15:33:07 UTC by Erik H:\n- notes changed: email sent to arrange zoom\nzoom arranged for mon -> email sent to arrange zoom\nzoom arranged for monday \n2023-08-17 15:33:11 UTC by Erik H:\n- notes changed: email sent to arrange zoom\nzoom arranged for monday  -> email sent to arrange zoom\nzoom arranged for monday 21\n2023-08-17 15:33:19 UTC by Erik H:\n- notes changed: email sent to arrange zoom\nzoom arranged for monday 21 -> email sent to arrange zoom\nzoom arranged for monday 21st aug @ 6PM CET.\n2023-08-22 14:56:13 UTC by Erik H:\n- notes changed: email sent to arrange zoom\nzoom arranged for monday 21st aug @ 6PM CET. -> email sent to 