ing    D) Complexity Theory   E) Meditation     F) We-Space practices like Circling, Authentic Relating and/or Collective Presencing\\A) 3 B) 2 C) 3 D) 1 E)4 F)5 -:- We are dedicated to consciously communicating with care and honesty. We question our own beliefs, explore comfort in not knowing, and welcome shared inquiry. We are willing to have difficult conversations and make space to hear another. We check in with ourselves about our reactions and needs in conversation.  When we don't meet our standards we are committed to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\A joyful and wholehearted Yes\nAnd thank you for creating this space		\N	2022-11-25 06:57:18.380136	2023-10-19 03:47:52.529206	2022-11-23 06:00:00	Eve	D	13767275	\N	\N	99K2rgSMEr7H8PecDR11SvB3	c-WQ37P8Y5mrYvLcsEHLjA	2023-01-09 03:50:34 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- greeter changed: (blank) -> Kevin Triplett\n	329	\N	t	\N	\N	f
