600	Andy Hansen	andrewdominic87@gmail.com	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/members/10721624	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/chats/new?user_id=10721624	\N	2022-03-28 00:00:00	existing	Minneapolis, MN	Do you know someone in this community?  If so, please share their name!\n\\Burton Anderson -:- What drew you to this community?  What do you hope to experience here?\n\\I'm hoping to connect with people who care about the same things as i do! Honest inquiry and dialogue, sensemaking in community. I want to talk about and hear about the things I am interested in -:- We do not have an individual or a team creating, curating or broadcasting content.  It's our members that bring the content, create events, start groups and spark discussion.  What lights you up and how do you think you might share that here?\\Reiki, Shadow Work, Astrology, Psychology, Integral Theory, Sound Healing, Human Design, The Gene Keys, Sankalpa, Ceremony, Yoga, Meditation -:- The following list shows some of the interests of some members in this community.  To help us understand where our new members are starting out (this is not a test), please let us know which of the following topics you are familiar with by typing a number after each from 1 to 5, with 1= not familiar and 5= very familiar.  \nA) Integral Theory    B) Game B    C) Sensemaking    D) Complex Theory   E) Meditation     F) We-Space practices like Circling, Authentic Relating and/or Collective Presencing\\A) 5 B)3 C)5 D) 1 E)5 F) 3 -:- We are dedicated to consciously communicating with care and honesty. We question our own beliefs, explore comfort in not knowing, and welcome shared inquiry. We are willing to have difficult conversations and make space to hear another. We check in with ourselves about our reactions and needs in conversation.  When we don't meet our standards we are committed to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\Yes!	\N	\N	2022-12-11 08:05:12.247373	202