599	Pauline Drewfs	hallo@paulinedrewfs.de	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/members/10700527	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/chats/new?user_id=10700527	\N	2022-03-26 00:00:00	existing	Berlin, Germany	Do you know someone in this community?  If so, please share their name!\n\\Daniel deTerrence Brooks -:- What drew you to this community?  What do you hope to experience here?\n\\I'm interested in climbing out of my bubble and see the world through the lens of other people's experiences in backgrounds. I love the phrase "how we relate is even more important than what we do" - I believe in that and hope to both be able to benefit from as well as contribute to this way of looking at the world. -:- We do not have an individual or a team creating, curating or broadcasting content.  It's our members that bring the content, create events, start groups and spark discussion.  What lights you up and how do you think you might share that here?\\I am an Authentic Relating facilitator and love creating experiences for all kinds of people. I'm hoping I can bring in my expertise, especially around how to have difficult conversations. -:- The following list shows some of the interests of some members in this community.  To help us understand where our new members are starting out (this is not a test), please let us know which of the following topics you are familiar with by typing a number after each from 1 to 5, with 1= not familiar and 5= very familiar.  \nA) Integral Theory    B) Game B    C) Sensemaking    D) Complex Theory   E) Meditation     F) We-Space practices like Circling, Authentic Relating and/or Collective Presencing\\A) 3\nB) 1\nC) 2\nD) 1\nE) 4\nF) 5 -:- We are dedicated to consciously communicating with care and honesty. We question our own beliefs, explore comfort in not knowing, and welcome shared inquiry. We are willing to have difficult conversations and make space to hear another. We check in with ourselves about our reactions and needs in conversation.  When we don't meet our standards we are committed to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\YES!	\N	\N	2022-12-11 08:05:12.236914	2023-10-19 03:47:50.641554	\N	Pauline	Drewfs	10700527	Europe/Berlin	DEU	vqYMFf6Za2vpxweSx2DCspPW	5gXGYXgCONAHoAaeHeUVvw	\N	\N	\N	t	\N	\N	f
