608	Ellen Cool	ellenkdance@aol.com	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/members/11284253	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/chats/new?user_id=11284253	\N	2022-05-16 00:00:00	existing	Anderson Island, WA	Do you know someone in this community?  If so, please share their name!\n\\ibndirectly David Fuller at Rebel Wisdom -:- What drew you to this community?  What do you hope to experience here?\n\\Discussion on the paradigm shift with like minded thinkers -:- We do not have an individual or a team creating, curating or broadcasting content.  It's our members that bring the content, create events, start groups and spark discussion.  What lights you up and how do you think you might share that here?\\I am a PhDc at CIIS in transformative studies and consiousness and I am passionate about activating the shift to a participatory integral worldview structure. I can share my visions of future GAIA and ideas on how to initiate and bring change through action. -:- The following list shows some of the interests of some members in this community.  To help us understand where our new members are starting out (this is not a test), please let us know which of the following topics you are familiar with by typing a number after each from 1 to 5, with 1= not familiar and 5= very familiar.  \nA) Integral Theory    B) Game B    C) Sensemaking    D) Complex Theory   E) Meditation     F) We-Space practices like Circling, Authentic Relating and/or Collective Presencing\\I am a 5 on all these topics. -:- We are dedicated to consciously communicating with care and honesty. We question our own beliefs, explore comfort in not knowing, and welcome shared inquiry. We are willing to have difficult conversations and make space to hear another. We check in with ourselves about our reactions and needs in conversation.  When we don't meet our standards we are committed to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\YES	\N	\N	2022-12-11 08:05:12.3335