ing up a mighty networks group for a client? 	\N	2023-01-15 18:00:23.779026	2023-10-19 03:47:52.954423	2023-01-20 17:30:00	Rob	Hurwich	14605193	\N	\N	eZkNhUZpYZGYJDzVisr9w2Yv	v3y3nkcx5Ozg2ohvjNIyQQ	2023-01-15 20:13:52 UTC by damien maguire:\n- when_timestamp changed: (blank) -> 2023-01-20T00:00:00.000Z\n2023-01-15 20:13:55 UTC by damien maguire:\n- when_timestamp changed: 2023-01-20 00:00:00 UTC -> 2023-01-20T11:00:00.000Z\n2023-01-15 20:13:56 UTC by damien maguire:\n- when_timestamp changed: 2023-01-20 11:00:00 UTC -> 2023-01-20T15:00:00.000Z\n2023-01-15 20:14:02 UTC by damien maguire:\n- when_timestamp changed: 2023-01-20 15:00:00 UTC -> 2023-01-19T15:00:00.000Z\n2023-01-15 20:14:57 UTC\n- Join request approved by damien maguire\n2023-01-15 20:32:45 UTC by damien maguire:\n- status changed: Joined! -> 1st Email Sent\n2023-01-15 20:41:44 UTC by damien maguire:\n- when_timestamp changed: 2023-01-19 15:00:00 UTC -> (blank)\n2023-01-16 08:04:27 UTC by damien maguire:\n- when_timestamp changed: (blank) -> 2023-01-20T00:00:00.000Z\n2023-01-16 08:04:30 UTC by damien maguire:\n- when_timestamp changed: 2023-01-20 00:00:00 UTC -> 2023-01-20T11:00:00.000Z\n2023-01-16 08:04:31 UTC by damien maguire:\n- when_timestamp changed: 2023-01-20 11:00:00 UTC -> 2023-01-20T15:00:00.000Z\n2023-01-16 08:04:32 UTC by damien maguire:\n- when_timestamp changed: 2023-01-20 15:00:00 UTC -> 2023-01-20T17:00:00.000Z\n2023-01-16 08:04:36 UTC by damien maguire:\n- when_timestamp changed: 2023-01-20 17:00:00 UTC -> 2023-01-20T17:10:00.000Z\n2023-01-16 08:04:39 UTC by damien maguire:\n- when_timestamp changed: 2023-01-20 17:10:00 UTC -> 2023-01-20T17:30:00.000Z\n2023-01-16 08:04:54 UTC by damien maguire:\n- status changed: 1st Email Sent -> Greet Scheduled\n2023-01-20 17:55:45 UTC by damien maguire:\n- status changed: Greet Scheduled -> Completed\n2023-01-20 17:56:11 UTC by damien maguire:\n- notes changed: (blank) -> He is setting up a mighty networks group for a client\n2023-01-20 17:56:19 UTC b