723	Ben Smith	ben@goodsensemaking.com	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/members/15131093	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/chats/new?user_id=15131093	2023-02-16 19:56:00	2023-02-16 00:00:00	Zoom Done (completed)	\N	Do you know someone in this community?  If so, please share their full name.\n\\No, but I've recently been following Patrick Wentorp's work on YouTube and also have been a long time fan of Daniel Schmachtenberger's work with The Consilience Project, so I'm well-versed in all things MetaCrisis & sensemaking related. -:- Because a main focus in this community is relational in nature, we strongly using real names-- at the very least a first name and last initial.  We also strongly encourage the use of real photos. What drew you to this community?  What do you hope to experience here?\n\\I only stumbled upon this from Patrick Wentorp's YT channel. I suppose my hope would be to be able to productively contribute meaningful ideas. -:- We do not have an individual or a team creating, curating or broadcasting content.  It's our members that bring the content, create events, start groups and spark discussion.  What lights you up and how do you think you might share that here?\\What lights me up most is exploring potential solution ideas that may elucidate a path out of this MetaCrisis. Basically isolating & understanding what civic actions we can lean into that'll do the most good for steering ourselves into a better more sustainable future. -:- The following list shows some interests of some members in this community.  To help us understand where our new members are starting out (this is not a test), please let us know which of the following topics you are familiar with by typing a number after each from 1 to 5, with 1= not familiar and 5= very familiar.  \nA) Integral Theory    B) Game B    C) Sensemaking    D) Complexity Theory   E) Meditation     F) We-Space practices like Circling, Authentic Relating and/or Collective Presencing\\A1, B5, C5, D1, E5, F1 (so I've heard of all these but am only adeptly familiar with Game B, Sensemaking, & Meditation) -:- We are dedicated to consciously communicating with care and honesty. We question our own beliefs, explore comfort in not knowing, and welcome shared inquiry. We are willing to have difficult conversations and make space to hear another. We check in with ourselves about our reactions and needs in conversation.  When we don't meet our standards we are committed to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\Absolutely, couldn't agree more.	\N	\N	2023-02-16 20:02:32.847712	2023-10-19 03:47:53.127349	2023-03-22 20:00:00	Ben	Smith	15131093	\N	\N	cw7gaKATvjdUfn6sr4rJRejB	\N	2023-02-16 20:32:44 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- greeter changed: (blank) -> Kevin Triplett\n2023-02-16 20:33:15 UTC\n- Join request approved by Kevin Triplett\n2023-02-16 20:33:24 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- shadow_greeter changed: (blank) -> Kevin Triplett\n2023-02-16 20:33:27 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- shadow_greeter_id changed: 329 -> (blank)\n2023-03-15 06:18:39 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- when_timestamp changed: (blank) -> 2023-03-15 21:00:00 UTC\n2023-03-16 05:21:41 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- when_timestamp changed: 2023-03-15 21:00:00 UTC -> 2023-03-22 20:00:00 UTC\n	329	\N	t	\N	\N	f
685	Toby Harper	toby.m.harper@gmail.com	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/members/14411477	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/chats/new?user_id=14411477	2023-01-04 14:28:00	\N	No Response (completed)	\N	Do you know someone in this community?  If so, please share their full name.\n\\No -:- Because a main focus in this community is relational in nature, we strongly using real names-- at the very least a first name and last initial.  We also strongly encourage the use of real photos. What drew you to this community?  What do you hope to experience here?\n\\It was essentially what I saw as a collective knee-jerk response to Covid that had so many negative externalities that were not openly engaged with that made me drastically lose touch with our institutions and people's ability to maintain mental flexibility in crisis. This started me on a mission to make sense of it all and I found RW as a result. I hope to engage with like minded individuals and hopefully find some friends in my city.  -:- We do not have an individual or a team creating, curating or broadcasting content.  It's our members that bring the content, create events, start groups and spark discussion.  What lights you up and how do you think you might share that here?\\I enjoy conversation and sharing of perspectives on tricky topics where there is an agreement that we don't quite yet know the answers. I love people who are curious about the world, and seek to really try and steel-man everyone and give all sides of any argument the most credit possible. I think I can offer perspectives from my own experience that others may feel similar to.   -:- The following list shows some interests of some members in this community.  To help us understand where our new members are starting out (this is not a test), please let us know which of the following topics you are familiar with by typing a number after each from 1 to 5, with 1= not familiar and 5= very familiar.  \nA) Integral Theory    B) Game B    C) Sensemaking    D) Complexity Theory   E) Meditation     F) We-Space practices like Circling, Authentic Relating and/or Collective Presencing\\A) 1\nB) 3\nC) 3\nD) 2\nE) 3\nF) 1 -:- We are dedicated to consciously communicating with care and honesty. We question our own beliefs, explore comfort in not knowing, and welcome shared inquiry. We are willing to have difficult conversations and make space to hear another. We check in with ourselves about our reactions and needs in conversation.  When we don't meet our standards we are committed to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\I agree	Was a no show -- I sent an email offering to reschedule but no response	\N	2023-01-04 16:01:10.852387	2023-02-12 05:13:59.299864	\N	Toby	Harper	\N	\N	\N	GBAV14GEEzp2Zi9iqmwcAaDL	hoS7GYDiPSFLKL5T1qOtJw	2023-01-05T00:27:35Z by Kevin Triplett:\n- status changed: Pending -> Joined!\n- greeter changed: (blank) -> (blank)\n- shadow_greeter changed: (blank) -> (blank)\n- notes changed: (blank) -> Approved by Kevin Triplett\n- profile_url changed: (blank) -> https://emergent-commons.mn.co/members/14411477\n- chat_url changed: (blank) -> https://emergent-commons.mn.co/chats/new?user_id=14411477\n2023-01-05 15:11:30 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- status changed: Joined! -> 1st Email Sent\n2023-01-05 15:11:41 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- notes changed: Approved by Kevin Triplett -> (blank)\n2023-01-05 20:34:43 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- greeter_id changed: 329 -> Kevin Triplett\n2023-01-05 20:34:47 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- greeter_id changed: 329 -> Kevin Triplett\n2023-01-05 20:34:52 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- greeter_id changed: 329 -> Kevin Triplett\n2023-01-05 20:37:53 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- greeter_id changed: 329 -> Kevin Triplett\n2023-01-08 01:18:44 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- status changed: 1st Email Sent -> Greet Scheduled\n2023-01-08 01:18:48 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- when_timestamp changed: (blank) -> 2023-01-09T06:00:00.000Z\n2023-01-08 0