 are committed to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\Yes.	meeting needs to be moved to different day 1st email sent march 4th	\N	2023-03-06 01:00:47.138308	2023-10-19 03:47:53.213465	\N	Jason	Sears	15416678	\N	\N	6DKobDUv85eGPdcDKW3ByzsX	\N	2023-03-07 16:43:10 UTC by Fahiym Hanna:\n- greeter changed: (blank) -> Fahiym Hanna\n2023-03-07 16:43:12 UTC by Fahiym Hanna:\n- status changed: Scheduling Zoom -> Zoom Scheduled\n2023-03-07 16:45:27 UTC by Fahiym Hanna:\n- when_timestamp changed: (blank) -> 2023-03-08 09:00:00 UTC\n2023-03-07 16:46:11 UTC by Fahiym Hanna:\n- notes changed: (blank) -> 1st email sent march 4th\n2023-03-08 18:25:25 UTC by Fahiym Hanna:\n- status changed: Zoom Scheduled -> Scheduling Zoom\n- when_timestamp changed: 2023-03-08 09:00:00 UTC -> (blank)\n2023-03-08 18:25:28 UTC by Fahiym Hanna:\n- status changed: Scheduling Zoom -> Zoom Scheduled\n2023-03-08 18:26:02 UTC by Fahiym Hanna:\n- notes changed: 1st email sent march 4th -> meeting needs to be moved to different day 1st email sent march 4th\n	556	\N	t	\N	\N	f
