7	Hayden P	hpozzi@pm.me	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/members/13771433	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/chats/new?user_id=13771433	2022-11-23 20:12:00	\N	Zoom Scheduled	\N	Do you know someone in this community?  If so, please share their full name.\n\\None -:- Because a main focus in this community is relational in nature, we strongly using real names-- at the very least a first name and last initial.  We also strongly encourage the use of real photos. What drew you to this community?  What do you hope to experience here?\n\\Being honest, I'm not super familiar with Emergent Commons. I am familiar with many of its neighbors however (Game~B, The Portal (Eric), JBP, etc...).\nI'm seeking to be part of a community of divergent thinkers from every part of the world. I want to be where the whole truth is spoken and discussed, and where integrity is the norm.\n\nI may add a real photo soon, but I'm always concerned about internet privacy, so I'd like to be familiar with the community first. -:- We do not have an individual or a team creating, curating or broadcasting content.  It's our members that bring the content, create events, start groups and spark discussion.  What lights you up and how do you think you might share that here?\\Complex Systems Science. I'm studying to be a systems scientist and mathematician, and I want to use systems science to create positive change.  I'm not sure how much I'll talk about systems science (depends on whether others are interested), but I know I will discuss ways to improve society.\n\nAs a side hustle, I think I'll urge people to learn mathematics, physics and systems science, and provide learning resources for each.\nAdditionally, I like art, music, and philosophy so discuss those also. -:- The following list shows some interests of some members in this community.  To help us understand where our new members are starting out (this is not a test), please let us know which of the following topics you are familiar with by typing a number after each from 1 to 5, with 1= not familiar and 5= very familiar.  \nA) Integral Theory    B) Game B    C) Sensemaking    D) Complexity Theory   E) Meditation     F) We-Space practices like Circling, Authentic Relating and/or Collective Presencing\\A) 2\nB) 2\nC) 4\nD) 3\nE) 2\nF) 1 -:- We are dedicated to consciously communicating with care and honesty. We question our own beliefs, explore comfort in not knowing, and welcome shared inquiry. We are willing to have difficult conversations and make space to hear another. We check in with ourselves about our reactions and needs in conversation.  When we don't meet our standards we are committed to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\I agree		\N	2022-11-25 06:57:18.367634	2023-02-12 05:14:00.243558	2022-12-09 22:00:00	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Y9wm8gYyhZ7Lpys792WubwPF	lv3lyN1AmXaqrRTzidDfcg	\N	\N	\N	t	\N	\N	\N
