or Collective Presencing\\A 3, B 5, C 4, D 5, E 4, F 3 -:- We are dedicated to consciously communicating with care and honesty. We question our own beliefs, explore comfort in not knowing, and welcome shared inquiry. We are willing to have difficult conversations and make space to hear another. We check in with ourselves about our reactions and needs in conversation.  When we don't meet our standards we are committed to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\Yes. I will do my best to honor this community standard.	\N	\N	2023-06-21 22:00:52.734839	2023-10-19 03:47:53.629106	2023-06-28 17:15:00	Lee	Chazen	17252807	\N	\N	k9Y6TYJfyqintP6YDHXcfHUq	\N	2023-06-22 18:26:53 UTC by mari budlong:\n- greeter changed: (blank) -> mari budlong\n2023-06-22 19:40:48 UTC by mari budlong:\n- when_timestamp changed: (blank) -> 2023-06-28 17:15:00 UTC\n	207	\N	t	\N	\N	f
