ng    D) Complexity Theory   E) Meditation     F) We-Space practices like Circling, Authentic Relating and/or Collective Presencing\\A=1, B=1, C=1, D=4, E=5, F=1 -:- We are dedicated to consciously communicating with care and honesty. We question our own beliefs, explore comfort in not knowing, and welcome shared inquiry. We are willing to have difficult conversations and make space to hear another. We check in with ourselves about our reactions and needs in conversation.  When we don't meet our standards we are committed to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\Yes, these are the ways I try to live my life.	\N	\N	2023-06-22 13:50:51.462629	2023-10-19 03:47:53.636577	\N	Glen	Mazis	17266236	\N	\N	4dRVunut1WW8A71uqLj4seom	\N	2023-06-22 18:26:56 UTC by mari budlong:\n- greeter changed: (blank) -> mari budlong\n	207	\N	t	\N	\N	f
