th 1= not familiar and 5= very familiar.  \nA) Integral Theory    B) Game B    C) Sensemaking    D) Complexity Theory   E) Meditation     F) We-Space practices like Circling, Authentic Relating and/or Collective Presencing\\A5,B4,C4,D3 E5,F3\n -:- We are dedicated to consciously communicating with care and honesty. We question our own beliefs, explore comfort in not knowing, and welcome shared inquiry. We are willing to have difficult conversations and make space to hear another. We check in with ourselves about our reactions and needs in conversation.  When we don't meet our standards we are committed to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\Totally, unreservedly Agree	Approved (Kimberly requested approval) and invite sent 10/4	\N	2023-10-02 16:00:24.926745	2023-11-07 04:55:45.325445	\N	Dennis	McCracken	13538915	\N	\N	E9k7iwNrLWaenw2QDjm52zwc	\N	2023-10-03 02:09:55 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- greeter changed: (blank) -> Kevin Triplett\n2023-10-04 17:26:00 UTC\n- Join approval requested by Kevin Triplett\n2023-10-05 00:26:02 UTC by Kevin Triplett:\n- notes changed: (blank) -> Approved (Kimberly requested approval) and invite sent 10/4\n	329	\N	t	\N	\N	\N
