ort in not knowing, and welcome shared inquiry. We are willing to have difficult conversations and make space to hear another. We check in with ourselves about our reactions and needs in conversation.  When we don't meet our standards we are committed to learning, improving and staying related.\nDo you agree to joining our community and relating in this way?\\I do, and what's more, I think it is the only way to conduct oneself if we are to progress our society.	Invited by Don Salmon - acceptable answers - first e-mail sent - zoom scheduled - re-scheduling zoom Andrew is ill - Andrew is a  very open and straight forward psycho therapist in his late 30s. working on a second master in biblical studies. A very positive fit for EC. - He very much appreciated the zoom filter -	\N	2023-09-20 13:30:44.534919	2023-10-19 03:56:16.88371	2023-10-13 19:00:00	Andrew	Cheadle	18958565	\N	\N	tyB1ZJQoBPEcXqdyCRu4RuPS	\N	2023-09-20 20:57:48 UTC by Esperanza V. Rodriguez:\n- greeter changed: (blank) -> Esperanza V. Rodriguez\n2023-09-20 21:00:32 UTC by Esperanza V. Rodriguez:\n- notes changed: (blank) -> 1st e-mail sent - invited by Don Salmon -\n2023-09-21 09:25:15 UTC by Esperanza V. Rodriguez:\n- notes changed: 1st e-mail sent - invited by Don Salmon - -> Acceptable answers - first e-mail sent - invited by Don Salmon -\n2023-09-25 15:52:02 UTC by Esperanza V. Rodriguez:\n- when_timestamp changed: (blank) -> 2023-09-29 18:00:00 UTC\n2023-09-25 15:52:24 UTC by Esperanza V. Rodriguez:\n- notes changed: Acceptable answers - first e-mail sent - invited by Don Salmon - -> Acceptable answers - first e-mail sent - invited by Don Salmon - zoom scheduled -\n2023-09-29 12:00:15 UTC by Esperanza V. Rodriguez:\n- notes changed: Acceptable answers - first e-mail sent - invited by Don Salmon - zoom scheduled - -> Invited by Don Salmon - acceptable answers - first e-mail sent - zoom scheduled -\n2023-09-30 15:21:13 UTC by Esperanza V. Rodriguez:\n- notes changed: Invited by Don Salmon - acceptable 