478	Jack Howarth	jadhowarth@hotmail.co.uk	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/members/8577224	https://emergent-commons.mn.co/chats/new?user_id=8577224	\N	2021-09-14 00:00:00	existing	North Shields, United Kingdom	What drew you to this community and what are you hoping to experience here?\n\\I have been aware of a void in my life since finishing the Rebel Wisdom sensemaking 101 course. I am hoping this might help with that. I am also really interested in emergent conversation. A space of creation that opens up possibility beyond the individuals themselves and what they perceive to already understand about reality. There is a magic in participating in a space that flows beyond our limitations that I can only access with the help of the other within the right cultavation framework -:- How did you hear about us?\n\\I heard about this space in a Rebel Wisdom hosted free online event, Crowd-sourced Wisdom with Alexandar Beinar -:- What lights you up and how do you think you might share that here?\\How do I answer this succintly? Not knowing, exploration, the humbling gaze at the mysteries of the universe. My own spiritual awakening experiences. Listening to fascinating people who have a breadth of knowledge spanning so many topics that help us survive up coming existential threats. Listening. Being humbled by human capacity, nature, consciousness, God. These are just labels and cannot speak to the actual thing itself. I can get a little nervous sharing so development is required.  -:- To help us understand where our new members are starting out, please let us know which of the following topics you are familiar with, and type a number from 1-5 after the name where 1 = not very familiar and 5 = very familiar.\n\n* Integral Theory\n* Game B\n* Sensemaking\n* Complexity Theory\n* Circling\n* Authentic Relating\n* Meditation\n* Collective Presencing\n\\Integral Theory - 2\nGame B - 3\nSensemaking - 4\nComplexity Theory -1\nCircling -1\nAuthentic Relating - 2\nMeditation - 5\nCollective Presencing - 2\n -:- Do you already know a member of this community that would help guide you and speak well of your joining? Please enter their name below:\\Not that I am aware of	\N	\N	2022-12-11 08:05:07.719721	2023-10-19 03:47:49.647112	\N	Jack	Howarth	8577224	Europe/London	GBR	x7EzKgdpcZ5UvHSbcithGMs7	arfHB9PBY1YgLttcqAtDKA	\N	\N	\N	t	\N	\N	f
