COPY public.violations (id, name, description, template) FROM stdin;
1	Personal Attack	Also called ad-hominem attacks. A personal attack happens when someone criticizes another person's character, attributes, or motives, typically without providing any supporting evidence. This type of attack aims to undermine an individual's reputation rather than addressing their behavior or ideas.	
2	Doxxing	Disclosing private, personal details about a member.	
3	Commerce in the Commons	Posts soliciting products and services are welcome in the Marketplace.	
